1 REM FBCS PRT-0260
2 REM CLAIM A-10.2.4.1-TR84
3 REM TYPE INPUT
100 REM THE NUMERIC-VARIABLE OF A TIME-INQUIRY MAY BE AN ARRAY ELEMENT (10.2.2 PRODUCTION 7, APPENDIX E):
102 REM ELAPSED E(2) IN INPUT, LINE INPUT, MAT INPUT AND MAT LINE INPUT ASSIGNS THE POSITIVE TIME TO THAT
104 REM ELEMENT (10.2.4.1 L.5166-5176) AND LEAVES THE OTHER ELEMENTS UNCHANGED. THE REPLIES ARE IN
106 REM PRT-0260.IN; THE OUTPUT IS IN PRT-0260.OUT.
110 OPTION BASE 1
120 DIM E(3), F(2,2), V(2)
130 DECLARE STRING W$(2)
135 MAT E = ZER
136 MAT F = ZER
140 INPUT ELAPSED E(2): N
150 PRINT N; SGN(E(1)); SGN(E(2)); SGN(E(3))
160 LET I = 3
170 LINE INPUT ELAPSED E(I): A$
180 PRINT A$; SGN(E(1)); SGN(E(2)); SGN(E(3))
190 MAT INPUT ELAPSED F(2,1): V
200 PRINT V(1); V(2); SGN(F(1,1)); SGN(F(2,1)); SGN(F(2,2))
210 MAT LINE INPUT ELAPSED E(1): W$
220 PRINT W$(1); W$(2); SGN(E(1))
230 END
